<title>UK: Bank of Melbourne sets $150 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Bank of Melbourne sets $150 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Nomura International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK OF MELBOURNE LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    21.NOV.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    21.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    2.5 BP    SELL CONC  2.5 BP    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
